          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa makūmi atanò aho Azalia alī ntemi wa Yuda, Pekahia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Menahemu ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli mu Samalia; ūsuga ikanza lya myaka ībīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Pekahia akīīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA. Atagalūkile gīkī alekane nū būhūbi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, ūbo walī wabenheleja a Baisilaeli kūhūba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wa batūmami ba mu būsugi bokwe lina lyakwe Peka, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lemalia, ūng'wijomboka. Ūsola banhū makūmi atanò kūfuma Gileadi ūja nabo ī Samalia ūūkingīla ū munumba y'ikūlū ūnsanga ū Pekahia alī mu chumba sha kūpīlīla ūmūlagīla ng'wenūmo, hamò na Aligobi, na Alie. Na lūūlū ū Peka ūbiza wamūlaga ū Pekahia, ūbiza wei ū ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Pekahia, nī yose īyo wīyīta; yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Peka kūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa makūmi atanò na ībīlī aho Azalia alī ntemi wa Yuda, Peka ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lemalia ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli mu Samalia; ūsuga ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA. Atagalūkile gīkī alekane nū būhūbi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, ūbo walī wabenheleja a Baisilaeli kūhūba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jakwe ū ntemi Peka wa Isilaeli, wiza ntemi Tigilasi-pilesa wa Ashulu ūbadumīla ūdima mizengo ya, Ijoni, Abeli-beti-maaka, Yanoa, Kadeeshi, na Hazooli, nī Gileadi wīsola pyī nī Galilaya; nīyo pyī ī sī ya Nafutali, a banhū ba mu mapandī genayo ūbasaamīja Ashulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo Hoshea ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ela ūng'wijomboka ū Peka ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lemalia. Ūntūla ūmūlaga, hūna ūbūsola wei ū būtemi; gwalī ng'waka gwa makūmi abīlī gwa būsugi wa ntemi Yotamu wa Yuda, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Uzia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Peka, nī yose īyo wīta; yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yotamu ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa kabīlī aho Peka ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lemalia alī ntemi wa Isilaeli, Yotamu ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Uzia ūbiza ntemi wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alandya kūbiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi abīlī n'ītanò; ūsuga ikanza lya myaka ikūmi n'ītandatū alī mu Yelusalemu. Ū nina witanagwa Yelusha, nshīke o ng'wa Sadoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yotamu akīīta yawiza ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, kūlenganīla nū mumo walī wītīla ise Uzia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a mapandī ga higūlya gatīnjiwe; a banhū baalī bataalī būja koi kūfunya shitambò na kūzuukīja būbbani. Ū Yotamu akagūbeegeleja ū mita gwa kū lwandī lwa kwigūlya lwa hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yotamu, pyī īyo wīta; yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ū mu shikū jenījo ū SEEBA wandya kūntūma ntemi Lezini wa Alamu na Peka ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lemalia kūja kwīdumīla ī Yuda.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yotamu nang'hwe wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa hamò nabo mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi nkūlūgenji wakwe. Ng'witūnja wakwe Ahazi ūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
